{
  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its design and siting, would appear out-keeping with the prevailing character of the surrounding area and result in an increased sense of enclosure by eroding the spaciousness between the two parallel end of terrace properties.&amp;nbsp; The proposal would therefore be contrary to the following policies which seek to ensure that developments are sympathetic to local character:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -Policies SP2 and DMD1 of The Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September 2024)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by virtue of siting, scale and appearance, would result in detrimental harm to the neighbouring property.&amp;nbsp; Specifically, the proposed development would result in an unacceptable material loss of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;outlook&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;and overbearing impacts to the rear gardens &amp;amp; habitable rooms of no.1 Second Avenue as well as a material loss of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;daylight, overshadowing and overbearing impacts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to the rear gardens of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;no.2-6 Third Avenue.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The proposal therefore constitutes unneighbourly development which would adversely impact the health and quality of life of neighbouring residents and is contrary to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (DLUHC, 2024);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;- Policy D6 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;- Policy DMD1 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
